#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
trip - agent-native CLI for Trip.com Taiwan (tw.trip.com, zh-TW, TWD) hotels. No booking.

Zero dependencies (Python 3.8+ stdlib). Every command supports --json and
returns the {ok, data|error} envelope used by the other ~/Projects CLIs.
Exit codes: 0 ok, 1 api, 2 usage, 3 auth, 4 net/blocked.

Endpoints, measured 2026-10-30 with real requests (CDP Network capture on a
background tab of the user's signed-in Edge, then replayed with plain HTTPS)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Trip.com (Ctrip) "SOA2" JSON-over-POST services. Every hotel body carries a
`head` {platform:"PC", bu:"IBU", group:"trip", locale:"zh-TW", region:"TW",
currency:"TWD", ...}; headers x-ctx-Locale / x-ctx-Currency / locale /
currency. The site's own JS also adds anti-bot headers (phantom-token,
w-payload-source, x-ctx-wclient-req). Measured: those are NOT needed when the
request carries a signed-in session cookie (`cticket`); without a session
the hotel services answer 200 with an empty body (ResponseStatus extension
ResultId=201, no `data`) even with a fresh anonymous GUID cookie, and even
with replayed anti-bot headers. So every hotel call here goes over plain
HTTPS with the saved session cookies (`trip login`). `--via browser` runs the
same POST as fetch() inside a background tab of Edge (CDP 127.0.0.1:9222) on
https://tw.trip.com/robots.txt (measured: sets no cookies).

  POST https://tw.trip.com/restapi/soa2/34951/getHotelKeywords      (http, works anonymous too)
       typeahead. body {queryInfo:{keyword, actionType:"destination"}, head}.
       -> data.mainKeywordList.keywords[]: keyword.keywordContentInfo
       (keyword, displayTexts SUB_TITLE), controlInfo.keywordFilterItem.data
       (filterID "13|6790054" landmark / "19|617" city / "31|<id>" hotel,
       value, subType), controlInfo.regionInfo.basicCityModel (cityId,
       countryId). 心齋橋 -> landmark 13|6790054 in city 219 (大阪).
  POST https://tw.trip.com/restapi/soa2/34951/fetchHotelList        (http + session)
       search. body {date:{dateType:1,dateInfo:{checkInDate:"YYYYMMDD",
       checkOutDate}}, destination:{type:1,geo:{cityId,countryId},keyword},
       extraFilter:{childInfoItems:[{age}],sessionId}, filters:[...],
       roomQuantity, paging:{pageIndex,pageSize}, hotelIdFilter:
       {hotelAldyShown:[ids already shown]}, head}.
       filters (labels measured from the zh-TW list page SSR):
         29|1  value "<rooms>|<adults>"; 29|2|<age> value "2|<age>" per child
         80|1|0 value "1" 住宿總價 (含稅及附加費)   <- always sent: price = stay total
         80|2|1 value "2" 每間每晚價格 (含稅項及費用) (site default, not used)
         17|1 Trip.com 推薦, 17|3 最低價 (含稅), 17|4 最高價 (含稅),
         17|6 最受好評, 17|5 直線距離 (由近到遠)
         16|N 星級, 23|10 免費取消, 5|1 包含早餐, plus the typeahead filter.
       -> data.hotelList[]: hotelInfo.summary.hotelId, nameInfo, hotelStar,
       commentInfo (commentScore, commenterNumber), positionInfo
       (positionDesc "距離選擇的地點370公尺", zoneNames), advertiseInfo
       (isAdHotel/isAdSolt = sponsored), roomInfo[0].priceInfo.price (with
       80|1: the stay total incl. taxes/fees, e.g. "3 張床 × 3晚 含稅項及費用
       可能額外收費"), roomInfo[0].roomTags (advantageTags 免費取消/含早餐,
       promotionTags e.g. 白銀會員優惠 = member price);
       data.hotelListAddtionInfo.hotelTotalCount / isLastPage.
       Measured: page 2 with hotelAldyShown = page-1 ids -> 0 overlap; the
       site's own price order is NOT strictly monotonic (1837 then 1833) ->
       the CLI re-sorts its pool by total. Ad cards appear in 推薦 order
       (e.g. 688205, 1068771 with isAdHotel=true) -> dropped.
       Children change results: 心齋橋 3 adults -> 4602 hotels, cheapest a
       NT$399/bed dorm; 3 adults + child 7 -> 4462 hotels.
       Member prices: same list page anonymous vs signed in: hotel 132129124
       TWD17,433 vs TWD15,977 (others identical).
  GET  https://tw.trip.com/hotels/detail/?hotelId=..&checkIn=..        (http, SSR)
       Next.js flight payload (self.__next_f) contains hotelDetailResponse:
       hotelBaseInfo (name, starInfo, isFavoriteHotel), hotelPositionInfo
       (address, zoneName), hotelComment.comment (score, totalComment),
       hotelPolicyInfo.checkInAndOut, hotelFacilityPopV2; authInfo.isLogin.
  POST https://tw.trip.com/restapi/soa2/33269/getHotelRoomListOversea (http + session)
       rooms (also used for Taiwan hotels; measured with Taipei id 3182366).
       body {search:{hotelId, checkIn, checkOut, roomQuantity, adult,
       childInfoItems:[{age,bed:-1,meal:-1}], ...}, head}.
       -> data.roomList[] (the rates the page SHOWS for this party:
       key=physical room id, subRoomList[].skey), physicRoomMap (name,
       bedInfo, areaInfo), saleRoomMap[skey]: comparingAmount (= stay total,
       equals priceDetail.priceInfo.totalPrice for all 17 rates checked),
       priceInfo.price (per unit per night), cancelInfo (title,
       ladderDetailInfo[ladderType=Free].localTimeDesc), mealInfo.title
       ("含 2 客早餐"; absent = no meal), paymentInfo.paymentTitleNew
       (線上預付), guestCountInfo.guestCount, bookingStatusInfo
       (remainRoomQuantity, isBooking). CAVEAT: saleRoomMap also holds rates
       the page hides ("此房間無法容納您搜尋的旅客人數") -> only roomList rates
       are used; the others are counted as hidden_rates.
  POST https://tw.trip.com/restapi/soa2/27024/ssoIsLoginAndGetAccountInfo  (http + session)
       {head} -> isLogin "T", message 登入成功, maskedEmail, thirdTypes.
  POST https://tw.trip.com/restapi/soa2/27024/getUserInfo           (http + session)
       {locale, accessCode:"IBUPCAUTEHNTICATE", head} -> vipGrade (1 for this
       account; search cards show 白銀會員優惠 -> 1 = 白銀/Silver; other grade
       numbers not seen).
  POST https://online.trip.com/restapi/soa2/26974/getAllOrders.json (http + session)
       trips, read-only. {OrderStatusClassify:"All", Count, ...} ->
       OrderEnities[] (OrderID, OrderName, OrderStatusName, OrderTotalPrice,
       HotelOrderItems[] CheckInDate "/Date(ms+0800)/", NightAmount, RoomType).
  POST https://www.trip.com/restapi/soa2/26974/json/GetMyFavorites  (http + session)
       saved list. {QueryList:[{BizType:"HOTEL"}], ReturnCount, ...} ->
       TotalRecord, FavoriteList[] (FavoriteID, ProductID, ProductName).
  POST https://www.trip.com/restapi/soa2/26974/json/GetBizList      (http + session)
       favourite counts per category (BizList [] when nothing is saved).
  saved add/rm: the write call is not visible on the page target (not
       captured; probably sent from a worker), so the CLI clicks the hotel
       page's own 收藏 button (div.collectButton_hotelOverview_collectBtn*,
       icon class *_collectIcon_selected / *_collectIcon_unselected) in a
       background tab and then VERIFIES with GetMyFavorites. Measured: the
       click added FavoriteID 213045142 and a second click removed it; the
       button's aria-label stays "收藏" either way.

Cookies: tw.trip.com pages set ibulocale/ibulanguage/cookiePricesDisplayed
with Domain=trip.com (measured), which would flip the user's hk.trip.com
locale in Edge. The CLI never changes them over plain HTTPS (it only
overrides them in its own Cookie header), and the browser path snapshots
those three cookies before opening a tab and restores them after.

NEVER called: any booking, checkout, hold, payment or order-creation path.
Unofficial. Undocumented, private API - it can break without warning.
